data-note=\"38500c05a94778d2\" href=\"?note=38500c05a94778d2\" title=\"14-thm-closure-base-change\">14-thm-closure-base-change</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E,j\">\\(\\mathcal E,j\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯与 LT 拓扑，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:A\\hookrightarrow F\">\\(m:A\\hookrightarrow F\\)</span> 为单射。分离性、层性、闭性都在同一环境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 中解释。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[m]\">\\([m]\\)</span> 的闭包取于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(F)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsJClosed}(m,j)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsJClosed}(m,j)\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9135c45b14ec366c\" href=\"?note=9135c45b14ec366c\" title=\"14-df-j-sheaf-object\">14-df-j-sheaf-object</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1ff1b9c370bbaad1\" href=\"?note=1ff1b9c370bbaad1\" title=\"14-df-j-separated-objects\">14-df-j-separated-objects</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1131fa8ff0b18434\" href=\"?note=1131fa8ff0b18434\" title=\"14-df-j-closed-monomorphism\">14-df-j-closed-monomorphism</a> 的精确签名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(F,j,\\mathcal E)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(A,j,\\mathcal E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(F,j,\\mathcal E)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(A,j,\\mathcal E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(F,j,\\mathcal E)\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(A,j,\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsJClosed}(m,j)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(F,j,\\mathcal E)\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(A,j,\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsJClosed}(m,j)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 V.2 Lemma 4、V.3 Lemma 2，印刷226–227页，DjVu119。原稿记载曾核对这两个陈述的证明。第一项由单射消去及分离性直接得到；一般子对象只保证分离，不能直接称作层。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 是层且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 在其中闭。把稠密单射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:D\\hookrightarrow B\">\\(d:D\\hookrightarrow B\\)</span> 上到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的箭头先延拓到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span>；延拓箭头的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>-逆像闭且包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>，故为整个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，延拓唯一因子化到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。反向设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 也是层，将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_A\">\\(1_A\\)</span> 沿稠密 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\hookrightarrow\\overline A\">\\(A\\hookrightarrow\\overline A\\)</span> 延拓成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r:\\overline A\\to A\">\\(r:\\overline A\\to A\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 的分离性使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"mr\">\\(mr\\)</span> 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline A\\hookrightarrow F\">\\(\\overline A\\hookrightarrow F\\)</span>，所以两个单射代表相同子对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 闭。这里闭包是 LT 闭包，不是空间中通常的闭集运算。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-j-sheaf-object","status":"resolved","id":"9135c45b14ec366c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-separated-objects","status":"resolved","id":"1ff1b9c370bbaad1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-j-separated-objects]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-closed-monomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"1131fa8ff0b18434","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-j-closed-monomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-closure-base-change","status":"resolved","id":"38500c05a94778d2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-closure-base-change]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-sheaf-object","status":"resolved","id":"9135c45b14ec366c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$、$\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$、$\\mathrm{IsJClosed}(m,j)$ 分别采用 [[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]、[[14-df-j-separated-objects]]、[[14-df-j-closed-monomorphism]] 的精确签名。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-separated-objects","status":"resolved","id":"1ff1b9c370bbaad1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$、$\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$、$\\mathrm{IsJClosed}(m,j)$ 分别采用 [[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]、[[14-df-j-separated-objects]]、[[14-df-j-closed-monomorphism]] 的精确签名。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-closed-monomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"1131fa8ff0b18434","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$、$\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$、$\\mathrm{IsJClosed}(m,j)$ 分别采用 [[14-df-j-sheaf-object]]、[[14-df-j-separated-objects]]、[[14-df-j-closed-monomorphism]] 的精确签名。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E,j","display":false},{"tex":"m:A\\hookrightarrow F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"[m]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(X,j,\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsJClosed}(m,j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(F,j,\\mathcal E)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(A,j,\\mathcal E).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(F,j,\\mathcal E)\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{IsJSheaf}(A,j,\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsJClosed}(m,j)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"d:D\\hookrightarrow B","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"1_A","display":false},{"tex":"A\\hookrightarrow\\overline A","display":false},{"tex":"r:\\overline A\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"mr","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline A\\hookrightarrow F","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":2139,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-195","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-closed-subobject-sheaf|thm-277 — 层对象的闭子对象恰为子层]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-123","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-closed-subobject-sheaf]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-280","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-closed-subobject-sheaf]]"},{"id":"b2640a98d95a570c","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"闭包扩张性给出 $[m_A]\\leq[n_A]$，所以 $d_A$ 存在；$n_A$ 单保证唯一，且 $d_A$ 也单。由[[14-thm-closure-base-change]]的换基公式，$\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,a_j(A)}([d_A])=n_A^*\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,W_A}([m_A])=n_A^*[n_A]=\\top_{a_j(A)}$，故 $d_A$ 在 $a_j(A)$ 中稠密。$W_A$ 是层且 $[n_A]$ 闭，故[[14-thm-closed-subobject-sheaf]]保证 $a_j(A)$ 是层。定义的输出因代表选择而变化时，有唯一相容同构；[[14-thm-lt-sheafification-adjunction]]给出其完整泛性质和函子作用。本构造适用于任意初等拓扑斯，不需要先给它选一个站点。"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-closed-subobject-sheaf]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-202","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-closed-subobject-sheaf]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-196","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-closed-subobject-sheaf|thm-277 — 层对象的闭子对象恰为子层]]"},{"id":"592d7bea8469dc16","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5f5d7ce8b2ae609a","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"由[[14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier]]及[[14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure]]，$W_A=\\Omega_j^A$ 是层；[[14-thm-closed-subobject-sheaf]]给其子对象 $S_j(A)$ 分离。核对等式可按原书的闭图像论证检验：$\\kappa_Af=\\kappa_Ag$ 等价于 $f,g:B\\to A$ 的闭图像相同；$f$ 的图像包含于 $g$ 的闭图像，拉回后说明 $(g,f)$ 因子化通过闭对角。反向，$\\kappa_A$ 的两复合在对角上相等，又因其目标为层而在稠密的对角闭包上相等。因 $m_A$ 单，$\\kappa_A$ 与 $q_A$ 核对相同。"}],"outgoing":["9135c45b14ec366c","1ff1b9c370bbaad1","1131fa8ff0b18434","38500c05a94778d2"]}